  "stories": [
    {
      "id": "j3.astra.story.a",
      "questionGroup": "a",
      "title": "卷起来的角",
      "skippable": true,
      "beats": [
        {
          "id": "opening.1",
          "afterQuestion": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "You and your friend arrive at a small square with a map you drew yourselves. You look for somewhere to spread it out. The bench is still wet from the rain, so you move under a roof and try the narrow space below a window.",
          "translation": "你和朋友带着一张自己画的地图来到小广场，想找个地方把它摊开。长椅还带着雨水，于是你们躲到屋檐下，试着借用窗户下方窄窄的窗台。"
        },
        {
          "id": "opening.2",
          "afterQuestion": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "One corner keeps curling up. Your friend puts a key on it while you hold the other side. You follow the lines with your finger. Just as you find your route, a sudden wind lifts the paper and turns part of it over.",
          "translation": "地图的一角不停卷起来。朋友用一把钥匙压住，你按着另一边。你用手指沿着线条寻找，刚找到路线，一阵风就掀起纸张，翻出了背面的一部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": "opening.3",
          "afterQuestion": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "There is a tiny smiling face on the back, drawn long ago. You both laugh. Before leaving, you fold the map carefully, keeping that face on the outside. Your friend picks up the key, and you put the map in your pocket.",
          "translation": "背面露出一个很早以前画的小笑脸，你们都笑了。离开前，你仔细折好地图，特意把笑脸留在最外面。朋友收起钥匙，你把地图放进口袋。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "j3.astra.story.b",
      "questionGroup": "b",
      "title": "最后一格光",
      "skippable": true,
      "beats": [
        {
          "id": "opening.1",
          "afterQuestion": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "One evening, you and your friend walk along an unfamiliar path. A row of small windows runs along the wall. Sunlight comes through the last one, making a little golden square on the ground. You stop and reach for your phone.",
          "translation": "傍晚，你和朋友沿着一条陌生的小路散步。墙上排列着几扇小窗，阳光从最后一格穿过，在地面投下一小块金色。你停下来，伸手拿出手机。"
        },
        {
          "id": "opening.2",
          "afterQuestion": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "By the time you are ready, the light has moved towards a step. Your friend waits beside you. You both bend down and try a different angle. This time, the picture catches the light, but two pairs of shoes appear beside it too.",
          "translation": "等你准备好时，光已经慢慢移向台阶边。朋友在你身旁等着。你们一起蹲下来，换个角度再试。这次照片拍到了光，旁边却也出现了两双鞋。"
        },
        {
          "id": "opening.3",
          "afterQuestion": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "You start to cut the shoes out of the picture, then stop. They show who stood there together. You keep the whole photo and show it to your friend. As you walk back along the path, you glance at the last window. It is dark now.",
          "translation": "你正想把照片里的鞋裁掉，又停了下来。它们正好记录着当时谁一起站在那里。你保留了整张照片，拿给朋友看。沿小路往回走时，你望了一眼最后一格窗，它已经暗了。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
